      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start for the tone. To make it more effective for the debate, can you expand on the \"necessity\" part? Specifically, I want the official to address why the local populations aren't capable of governing themselves or managing their own resources without this kind of European oversight. It should reflect the actual attitudes of the time regarding their capacity for progress.",
